    m_Localized: "0% \xB7 Mute"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1024717011017728
    m_Localized: "harvest() / can_harvest()\nplant(Entities.Grass) / plant(Entities.Bush)
      / plant(Entities.Tree)\nplant(Entities.Carrot) / plant(Entities.Pumpkin)\nplant(Entities.Sunflower)
      / plant(Entities.Cactus)\nmove(North / East / South / West) -> True / False\ncan_move(direction)
      -> True / False\ntill() / use_item(Items.Water) / use_item(Items.Fertilizer)\nget_pos_x()
      / get_pos_y() / get_world_size()\nget_entity_type() / get_ground_type() / get_water()\nnum_items(Items.Hay)
      / num_unlocked(Unlocks.Speed)\nget_cost(Unlocks.Speed) / unlock(Unlocks.Speed)\nget_companion()
      -> (entity, (x, y)) or None\nmeasure() / measure(direction) / swap(direction)\nspawn_drone(function,
      args...) -> handle or None\nwait_for(handle) -> return value / has_finished(handle)\nnum_drones()
      / max_drones()\nget_time() / get_tick_count() / random()\nsimulate(file, unlocks,
      items, globals, seed, speedup)\nchange_hat(Hats.Straw_Hat) / change_hat(Hats.Dinosaur_Hat)\nset_world_size(size)
      / set_execution_speed(speed)\nclear() / do_a_flip()\nprint(values...) / quick_print(values...)\n\nNamespaces:
      Entities, Items, Grounds, Unlocks, Hats, Leaderboards.\nPrograms: import helpers
      / from helpers import tend.\nCollections: [1,2], (1,2), {1,2}, {'seed': 4}.\nData:
      values[0], costs['hay'], values.append(3), visited.add((x,y)).\nFunctions:
      def work(x, count=1): ... return result.\n\nA task has independent memory.
      Return values are collected by wait_for().\nA blocked maze move returns False.
      Normal field edges wrap; tail mode does not.\nSimulation creates a new isolated
      farm. It cannot modify the live inventory.\n\nCompetition uses an isolated
      8\xD78 mid-tier farm. Targets vary by resource; consult the challenge list
      and terminate every worker after reaching the target.\nCompanion requests require
      companion research. Merged harvests produce Weird Substance in proportion to
      the infected plants."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1024717015212032
    m_Localized: 'Execution speed multiplier per level: '
