    m_Localized: 'Build a network across six islands. Specialist machines share physical
      lanes: larger hulls carry more, but need wider routes.


      Unlock Carrots
      and prepare 100 Wood + 100 Carrots to sign the charter. The charter provides
      100 fleet credits. Slot count, hull size and role types are researched separately.
      Orders reward credits and open new islands.


      This mode has its own local
      depots and saved job queues. Main farm resources stay on the home farm. No
      elapsed-time unlock gates.'
