  - m_Id: 1262209932976131
    m_Localized: "Begin in your home garden. Cultivation and programming unlock the
      archipelago in the technology tree. Earth and every island share one economy
      and one program library.\n\nFloralia \xB7 flowers\nAurelia \xB7 minerals\nPelagia
      \xB7 fish"
