    m_Localized: Stock the mothership warehouse using actual UFO arrivals.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1300716885893136
    m_Localized: Six gardens
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1300716885893137
    m_Localized: Maintain six flower supply chains and send the full collection to
      the mothership.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1300716885893138
    m_Localized: The foundry ring
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1300716885893139
    m_Localized: Deliver smelted metals rather than ores; use larger mining hulls.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1300716885893140
    m_Localized: Open ocean survey
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1300716885893141
    m_Localized: Coordinate fishing routes for every common shoal.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1300716885893142
    m_Localized: Living soil
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1300716885893143
    m_Localized: Flower honey and marine fishmeal support Earth's ecological programme.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1300716885893144
    m_Localized: Precision observatory
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1300716885893145
    m_Localized: Combine bullion, platinum and botanical optics in orbit.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1300716885893146
    m_Localized: Ocean restoration
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1300716885893147
    m_Localized: Produce lotus and koi through both marine and botanical logistics.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1300716885893148
    m_Localized: Renewable infrastructure
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1300716885893149
    m_Localized: Supply orbital infrastructure through four-world freight.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1300716885893150
    m_Localized: Crystal telemetry
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1300716885893151
    m_Localized: Diamonds require mining, flowers, silver and cutting; run independent
      swarms.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1300716885893152
    m_Localized: Botanical seed vault
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1300716885893153
    m_Localized: Build a balanced six-species reserve in the mothership.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1300716885893154
    m_Localized: A silver ocean
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1300716885893155
    m_Localized: Deliver fish and refined metals together without starving the colonies.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1300716885893156
    m_Localized: Deep core observatory
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1300716885893157
    m_Localized: Sustain rare-ore processing alongside ordinary metal supply.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1300716885893158
    m_Localized: Distributed life support
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1300716885893159
    m_Localized: Balance local and orbital depots across every planet.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1300716885893160
    m_Localized: Four-world exhibition
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1300716885893161
    m_Localized: Deliver a curated botanical, marine and mineral collection.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1300716885893162
    m_Localized: Orbital research city
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1300716885893163
    m_Localized: Produce and transport an interdependent supply network at industrial
      scale.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1300716885893164
