  - m_Id: 1301782805340161
    m_Localized: Bush
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1301782805340162
    m_Localized: 18 / Mothership, landing & freight
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1301782805340163
    m_Localized: Locked worlds appear grey, each rotating on its own randomized axis.
      Select an unlocked planet to watch the shuttle descend from the mothership.
      Native workers stay local. Every interplanetary UFO route passes through the
      mother; use depot -1 to store and retrieve supplies. Cancellation deposits
      airborne cargo at its next dock, which may be the mother. Local solar energy
      is required to refuel.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1301782805340164
    m_Localized: 19 / Native research, growth & effects
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1301782805340165
    m_Localized: Research has Universe, Earth, Flower, Ocean and Mineral sectors.
      Planet discovery is in Universe. Green is production, blue automation, amber
      ecology, violet transport. Dark nodes are unresearched; bright nodes have a
      purchased level. Native research changes real recipe speed/yields; costs double
      per level, five levels per branch. Growth now changes crop shape continuously.
      A close-up is selected for small fields; harvest bursts use a bounded shared
      pool. Full-size surfaces cull distant/back-facing crop chunks and batch the
      visible instances. There is no fixed campaign timer gate.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1301782805340166
    m_Localized: 0.13.2 saves are isolated under Automation/Universe0131. Old farm
      files are retained and not silently converted into a different universe. Save
      physical cargo, queues, battery, surfaces, swarms and file bindings. Interpreter
      stacks,inboxes and result objects are transient; restart controllers after
      loading and inspect existing queues. Original race farms remain separate. Ctrl/Cmd+Z
      undo, Shift+Ctrl/Cmd+Z redo, F9 breakpoints and external editing remain.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
